{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The White Turban is a ",["l","帽子","hat"]," that can be ",["l","裁缝","tailored"]," using ",["l","布料","Cloth"]," and a ",["l","宝石甜莓","Sweet Gem Berry"]," at the sewing machine inside ",["l","柳巷2号","Emily's house"]," or the ",["l","缝纫机","Sewing Machine"]," received as a reward for the ",["l","任务","\"Rock Rejuvenation\""]," special order. It can also be obtained from ",["l","骷髅洞穴","treasure rooms"]," in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," (≈3.85% chance). The hat can rarely be found in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," as a ",["l","矿井","special item"],", from special monster drops or crates and barrels, during the ",["l","任务","'Danger In The Deep'"]," quest or after activating the ",["l","矿井","Shrine of Challenge"],"."]]]]]}